// Drovers' Reach (band lane, 2026-11-22; D:/LQOnline/world3/BRIEF.md section 4): levels 25 to 30, its own outdoor zone
// (src/data/maps/drovers_reach.js, generated by tools/maps/zone_drovers_reach.mjs), west of Larchhill through Drovers'
// Gap. Plain data, merged into the content by src/data/maps/index.js: its people, items and rewards, quests, two rares
// and its zone event. The foes are in src/data/band20.js.
//
// The story: the old drove roads once took the Downs' sheep and cattle to market. Then Harrow Coyle bought the tolls.
// His chain gang holds the roads now: tallymen count every head and write down every name, gangers break stone in
// chains, warders keep the Pound. The couriers' lists end here, in Coyle's hand, and his list goes on further: down,
// under the Downs, into the Barrow. (The Barrow Deep Halls are the cap30 lane's.) Text is original. No em dashes.
import { bandRare, questItem, rewardGear, whereIn, bandQuest } from './band20.js';

